<section begin=intro />
'''Seekers''' are tactical [[Grineer]] units with yellow-green armor and darker markings. Aside from using the {{Weapon|Kraken}} pistol, they will also deploy [[Latcher]]s. This ability makes them unlikely to rush into the front lines like any regular Grineer unit. More durable than regular Grineer [[Lancer]]s, these can be versatile opponents.
<section end=intro />

==Behaviour==
* Due to their habit of hiding away from actual combat, they can be more likely to use terminals in order to sound alarms and cause lockdowns than other units.
**This also means that you will often find yourself constantly bombarded with Latchers from Seekers that you cannot see.
**Use these time slots to your advantage as the Seeker is incapable of retaliating effectively, preferable to kill with a strong damage-per-bullet weapon to avoid being killed by their Kraken/Viper.
*Armed with a Kraken pistol.

==Notes==
*Seekers affected by {{WF|Nyx}}'s Mind Control or Chaos will deploy Latchers which are allied, causing enemies to become distracted by them if they come nearby. Although weak to a single shot by any [[Grineer]], a mind-controlled Seeker with duration can effectively spawn many Latchers, creating many possible entities that can redirect enemy fire.
* [[Shadows Of The Dead|Shadow]] Seekers do not deploy Latchers.

